# How to cite this software (Citation File Format 1.2). GitHub renders a "Cite this repository" button from it.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BioMS Zaku, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BioMS Zaku: an algebraic and predictive framework to decompose, audit and design bioimpedance indices and equations"
version: 1.0.0rc1
# EN: no `date-released` while the version is a release candidate that has not been released: CHANGELOG.md
#     says "1.0.0rc1 — unreleased", and a citation must not claim a date the software does not have.
#     Set it to the date of the tag when the release is made.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bioms-zaku-framework/bioms-zaku"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mota"
    given-names: "Thalles"
    email: "thallesleandromota@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "Universidade Federal de Mato Grosso, Brazil"
  - family-names: "Martins"
    given-names: "Claudia"
    email: "claudia@ic.ufmt.br"
    affiliation: "Universidade Federal de Mato Grosso, Brazil"
  - family-names: "Oliveira Gonçalves"
    given-names: "Luis Carlos"
